{"4555210":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Oar'some Adventures","steam_appid":4555210,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5057590],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GAME OVERVIEW<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends take a “relaxing” trip rafting down a massive river. Work together to navigate your way to the bottom of an elaborate river system and make it back to the safety of civilization.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/0652dddf9f2e372143bdbfd145792d19.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/0652dddf9f2e372143bdbfd145792d19.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/0652dddf9f2e372143bdbfd145792d19.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PADDLE!<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Rowing! You’ll need to work with your friends to have any chance of making it to the bottom of the river. Synchronize your rowing in order to navigate through dangerous obstacles and wild river rapids!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/4e0288570aa8e347d7a926a1b544d2a3.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/4e0288570aa8e347d7a926a1b544d2a3.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/4e0288570aa8e347d7a926a1b544d2a3.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>EXPLORE!<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where to next? Explore a vast world full of beautiful rivers and unique landmarks and co-operative puzzles. Complete challenges to continue downstream, and make tough decisions on which river (or path) to follow! Each trip down the river becomes unique or as familiar as you want.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/bb8971712e7047f8cb176bd2ef5f1fe9.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/bb8971712e7047f8cb176bd2ef5f1fe9.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/bb8971712e7047f8cb176bd2ef5f1fe9.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SURVIVE!<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make it! Getting to the bottom of the river won’t be easy. Watch out for a wide variety of natural wildlife, some friendly, others not so much... Each bump and crash will hurt you and your boat too! use your items wisely to make sure you and your friends survive the journey!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/b083667f6bcc4932a816859e8591e8f8.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/b083667f6bcc4932a816859e8591e8f8.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/b083667f6bcc4932a816859e8591e8f8.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GAME OVERVIEW<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends take a “relaxing” trip rafting down a massive river. Work together to navigate your way to the bottom of an elaborate river system and make it back to the safety of civilization.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/0652dddf9f2e372143bdbfd145792d19.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/0652dddf9f2e372143bdbfd145792d19.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/0652dddf9f2e372143bdbfd145792d19.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PADDLE!<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Rowing! You’ll need to work with your friends to have any chance of making it to the bottom of the river. Synchronize your rowing in order to navigate through dangerous obstacles and wild river rapids!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/4e0288570aa8e347d7a926a1b544d2a3.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/4e0288570aa8e347d7a926a1b544d2a3.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/4e0288570aa8e347d7a926a1b544d2a3.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>EXPLORE!<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where to next? Explore a vast world full of beautiful rivers and unique landmarks and co-operative puzzles. Complete challenges to continue downstream, and make tough decisions on which river (or path) to follow! Each trip down the river becomes unique or as familiar as you want.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/bb8971712e7047f8cb176bd2ef5f1fe9.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/bb8971712e7047f8cb176bd2ef5f1fe9.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/bb8971712e7047f8cb176bd2ef5f1fe9.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SURVIVE!<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make it! Getting to the bottom of the river won’t be easy. Watch out for a wide variety of natural wildlife, some friendly, others not so much... Each bump and crash will hurt you and your boat too! use your items wisely to make sure you and your friends survive the journey!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/b083667f6bcc4932a816859e8591e8f8.poster.avif?t=1792622024\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/b083667f6bcc4932a816859e8591e8f8.webm?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/extras\/b083667f6bcc4932a816859e8591e8f8.mp4?t=1792622024\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Paddles up, Hosers! OAR'SOME Adventures is a cozy\/chaotic rafting and nature adventure for 1-8 players. Casually paddle your way down the river alone, or gather your friends for whitewater mischief and exploration in beautiful, yet dangerous, surroundings.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Swedish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/e97c2090cd3e2e2637b37ae013dd745e4dcf5d61\/header.jpg?t=1792622024","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/47483bde697b65095ce23b6e821b7c17e8b7cd14\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792622024","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4555210\/47483bde697b65095ce23b6e821b7c17e8b7cd14\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792622024","website":"https:\/\/haymaker.games","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1060 or RX 6600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 @ 3.0 GHz or AMD<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> RTX 2060 or RX 7600xt or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[]}}}